  m_text: 'This level is a test level that allows players to test more mechanics and triggers. It has a water pond which is used to regenerate player stats to max, as well as spheres on the level the simulates bugs the player can eat in order to regenerate health. The walls are climbable as well. The boxes simulate different weight of the object of how much the frog can move the boxes. When Ready just press the red button on the house to return to the first level or Press ESC to return to the main menu. '
